<title>FRANCE: France to sell Bulgaria 5,000 T wheat as food aid.</title>
<headline>France to sell Bulgaria 5,000 T wheat as food aid.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>France will hold a tender on April 9 to sell 5,000 tonnes of soft wheat to Bulgaria as food aid, national grain office ONIC said.</p>
<p>The wheat is for shipment in bags from April 17, it said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
